  "description": "BLACK FRIDAY UPGRADE OPTIONS LIVE BELOW! See specials in the description.\n\nThe Maxwell 26 is a lightweight 26 inch full suspension mountain bike for kids who are ready to level up their trail riding. Built with 130mm of travel, boost spacing front and rear, and four awesome build level options starting under 26.5 pounds, it’s the perfect bike for riders moving up from 24 inch wheels. Designed for aggressive terrain, this playful and agile platform features a Horst link suspension design, SUPERLIGHT direct-mount cranks, 26,28, 30 or 32 tooth chainring options, multiple suspension fork options and several tire choices YOU can to configure for your ideal trail conditions and riding style!",
